# Token efficiency

- Never reread the entire repository by default.
- Never repeatedly summarize the full assessment.
- Prefer `CURRENT_STATE.md` + targeted requirement IDs + targeted file reads.
- Use search for needles; avoid printing entire large files.
- Prefer concise diffs and targeted test output.
- Do not regenerate existing docs unless content changed.
- Avoid unrelated refactors and premature future features.
- Autopilot / stretch work only after core gates in CURRENT_STATE.
